><span begin="01:59.585" end="02:00.426">blalala </span><span begin="02:00.426" end="02:01.445">byeahyeahyeah </span><span begin="02:01.445" end="02:01.524">never </span><span begin="02:01.524" end="02:01.828">getting </span><span begin="02:01.828" end="02:02.024">rid </span><span begin="02:02.024" end="02:02.178">of </span><span begin="02:02.178" end="02:02.602">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.915" end="02:09.479"><span begin="02:03.915" end="02:04.167">You </span><span begin="02:04.167" end="02:04.479">can </span><span begin="02:04.479" end="02:06.549">try </span><span begin="02:06.549" end="02:06.894">oh </span><span begin="02:06.894" end="02:07.232">but </span><span begin="02:07.232" end="02:09.479">I</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.797" end="02:13.287"><span begin="02:09.797" end="02:09.994">I </span><span begin="02:09.994" end="02:10.162">love </span><span begin="02:10.162" end="02:10.339">you </span><span begin="02:10.339" end="02:10.514">means </span><span begin="02:10.514" end="02:10.694">you're </span><span begin="02:10.694" end="02:11.043">never </span><span begin="02:11.043" end="02:11.360">ever </span><span begin="02:11.360" end="02:11.692">ever </span><span begin="02:11.692" end="02:12.069">getting </span><span begin="02:12.069" end="02:12.259">rid </span><span begin="02:12.259" end="02:12.452">of </span><span begin="02:12.452" end="02:13.287">me</span></p></div></body></tt>